<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: ADVISORY - Czech bourse results delayed.</title>
<headline>ADVISORY - Czech bourse results delayed.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Prague Stock Exchange (PSE) said that its daily fixing, which normally takes place at 0900 GMT, would be delayed on Tuesday by 30 minutes to 0930 GMT.</p>
<p>The PSE said that a technical problem with its communications network was to blame.</p>
<p>Continuous trading, which normally starts at 0945 GMT, will start at 1000 GMT, the PSE added.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
